$\n\\begin{aligned}{H}_{f}(x) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2xy-4x-2y+1) & \\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}-2x+6y) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂y}(2xy-4x-2y+1) & \\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{2}-2x+6y)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2y-4 & 2x-2 \\\\ 2x-2 & 6\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our Newton-Raphson formula is\n\n$$\n{x}_{n+1}={x}_{n}-{[\\begin{aligned}2y-4 & 2x-2 \\\\ 2x-2 & 6\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{n}}^{-1}{[\\begin{aligned}2xy-4x-2y+1 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2x+6y\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{n}}.\n$$\n\nStarting with\n${x}_{0}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & ={x}_{0}-{[\\begin{aligned}2y-4 & 2x-2 \\\\ 2x-2 & 6\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{0}}^{-1}{[\\begin{aligned}2xy-4x-2y+1 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2x+6y\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{0}} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]-{[\\begin{aligned}2(0)-4 & 2(1)-2 \\\\ 2(1)-2 & 6\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}[\\begin{aligned}2(1)(0)-4(1)-2(0)+1 \\\\ (1)^{2}-2(1)+6(0)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]-{[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 6\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]-\\frac{1}{(-4)\\cdot 6-(0)\\cdot (0)}[\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+\\frac{1}{24}[\\begin{aligned}-18 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ≈[\\begin{aligned}0.25 \\\\ 0.167\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536189 true] [17592186388001 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388002 13194139536189 true] [17592186388001 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388003 13194139536189 true] [17592186388001 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536189 true] [17592186388001 1041 "field-1" 13194139536189 true] [17592186388001 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388002 13194139536189 true] [17592186388001 1110 #uuid "29c5daf3-5e9d-5338-8bb7-f8edfe6b91d9" 13194139536189 true] [17592186388002 1034 "0.250" 13194139536189 true] [17592186388002 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536